  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "POV: it's 1am and you're off book tomorrow. Hide the lines in Ghost Light and say it out loud. #actorslife #offbook #monologue #audition #actortok",
    "youtube_title": "POV: it's 1am and you're off book tomorrow #shorts",
    "youtube_description": "Milo is off book tomorrow and still peeking at the page. In Ghost Light he opens Orlando from As You Like It, taps Run it and hides the lines. The speech goes to dots, and each line comes back as he says it out loud.\nFree on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#offbook #monologue #actorslife #audition",
    "instagram": "POV: it's 1am and you're off book tomorrow.\n\nSay a line, peek. Say a line, peek. Milo stopped counting sheep and started counting peeks.\n\nSo he opened Ghost Light, picked Orlando from As You Like It, tapped Run it and hid the lines. Say it out loud and every line you know comes back.\n\nFree on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio.\n\n#actorslife #offbook #monologue #audition #actorsofinstagram"
  },
